{
    "title": "Connections: Group words",
    "description": "Connections is a daily game about finding common threads between words. Players must select four groups of four words without making more than four mistakes. \r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\nFind groups of four items that share something in common in less than 4 mistakes.\r\n\r\nCategory Examples:\r\n\u25aa COLORS: red, yellow, blue, green\r\n\u25aa PLANETS: Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter\r\n\r\nEach group is assigned a color, wich indicates his difficulty:\r\n\ud83d\udfe8 Easy\r\n\ud83d\udfe9 Normal\r\n\ud83d\udfe6 Hard\r\n\ud83d\udfea Tricky\r\n\r\nEnjoy it !",
